                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2062a2f-4833-318e-91a3-c4b7da7ba538",
                                        "entry_id": "e82f9031-f7f4-3a38-afc9-48cdd75a11fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An imprecise measure of alcoholic drink; a \\\"slug\\\" (of gin), or an overlarge gulp."
